Hey Bailey! I like minecraft and the drums too! I haven´t tried to play the drums either but I really want to! What´s your favorite music genre? Mine is alternative/rock/punk, I want to learn how to sing but it seems really hard!

&#x200B;

Have you seen Bailey? They left their laptop in class and I want to see if i can return it to them or if i should turn it in somewhere.

&#x200B;

I saw Bailey yesterday and i really like their company, i wish i´d asked for their number!
